OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry but
OL,6,Fcloudy with bright spells in the east.
OL,7,FCloud will thicken by late morning
OL,8,Fwith the chance of the occasional
OL,9,Fshower later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with the chance of a
OL,12,Ffew evening showers west otherwise dry
OL,13,Fwith increasing clear spells becoming
OL,14,Fcloudy west again towards morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FCloudy but mostly dry with
OL,17,Fbright or sunny spells. Thickening
OL,18,Fcloud will spread southeast from the
OL,19,Fafternoon with patchy rain following
OL,20,Ffrom the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
