OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,7,Fsoutheast later Saturday. Sunday and
OL,8,FMonday will continue mostly dry with
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells. Increasing fog
OL,10,Frisk Monday.
